  description: Ogres are towering greenskins, head and shoulders above any man, with
    massive arms and thick torsos. They lumber rather than run, every step a slow,
    heavy stomp that you can feel through the ground. Their voices are crude speech,
    often simple words or bellowed threats, but always loud enough to rattle teeth.
